                          "埃蒂尔菲德位于巴旦尼亚边界，靠近萨哥特，种植小麦。"
                      ],
    "semanticPrototypes":  [

                           ],
    "kind":  "background",
    "scope":  "npc",
    "persistence":  "persistent",
